SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 45-minute easy Z2 spin at 128–150W only
  — no distance target
DESCRIPTION:45-minute easy Z2 spin at 128–150W only — no distance targe
 t\, focus on leg activation and keeping HR below 140bpm. Skip if body batt
 ery is under 40 on waking.\n\nReason: Only one training session logged in 
 4 weeks following illness (reported 15 Aug) and chronically low body batte
 ry\; jumping straight into a 100km ride risks injury or setback before the
  Half Oceanman.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
END:VEVENT
