SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — 30–40 min easy open-water swim\, 1\,00
 0–1\,500m at fully comfor
DESCRIPTION:30–40 min easy open-water swim\, 1\,000–1\,500m at fully co
 mfortable effort (no pace target) — treat as reactivation\, not a fitnes
 s session.\n\nReason: Post-illness return with near-zero training load in 
 4 weeks\; attempting 2\,500m at race pace on the first proper training day
  risks fatigue accumulation and discouragement — build confidence first.
 \n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
