SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 12–14km easy aerobic run @ 6:30–7:00/
 km — treat as a fitness
DESCRIPTION:12–14km easy aerobic run @ 6:30–7:00/km — treat as a fitn
 ess check\; stop early if HR trends high or pace is forced. No negative-sp
 lit attempt.\n\nReason: Following illness and four weeks of essentially ze
 ro training\, jumping to a 19km long run creates significant injury risk a
 nd excessive fatigue that would compromise the following week's swim-focus
 ed build toward the Half Oceanman.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
