SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 75–90km @ 128–160W (lower end of Z2 o
 nly)\, cap at 200 min — 
DESCRIPTION:75–90km @ 128–160W (lower end of Z2 only)\, cap at 200 min 
 — omit Z3 Tempo blocks this week\; treat as aerobic base re-establishmen
 t.\n\nReason: With only one week of return-to-training before this ride\, 
 a full 105km effort is premature\; a modest reduction protects recovery ca
 pacity needed for the three swim sessions per week required to prepare for
  the Half Oceanman swim.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-29
