SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 15–16km @ 6:30–6:45/km — steady aer
 obic effort\, no negative 
DESCRIPTION:15–16km @ 6:30–6:45/km — steady aerobic effort\, no negat
 ive split\; use HR cap of 150bpm as the primary guide.\n\nReason: Building
  run volume too quickly after an illness-disrupted block risks injury\; a 
 conservative week 11 long run still progresses fitness while keeping energ
 y available for the swim-priority sessions targeting the Half Oceanman.\n\
 nAI coaching 2026-08-29
