DESCRIPTION:90km easy Z2 ride @ 128–165W\, 180 min maximum — this is th
 e final long ride before the Half Oceanman (35 days away)\; replace volume
  with a 30-min open-water confidence swim in the afternoon (1\,500–2\,00
 0m easy) to simulate race familiarity.\n\nReason: With the Half Oceanman o
 nly ~16 days away at this point\, a 115km bike effort risks accumulated fa
 tigue that undermines taper quality and swim readiness — a reduced ride 
